OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested following
OL,4,ABelfast stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder,
OL,8,Ffollowing a stabbing in west Belfast on
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FPolice received a report at about 21:20
OL,12,FBST of an ongoing disturbance in the
OL,13,FSuffolk Glen area.
OL,15,FOfficers attended the scene, where a
OL,16,Fnumber of people were fighting in the
OL,17,Fstreet.
OL,19,FA man in his 20s was taken to hospital
OL,20,Fwith non life-threatening stab wounds,
OL,21,Fwhere he remains in stable condition.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
